  "description": "Connects the OASIS to Hedera Hashgraph -- aBFT DLT using the hashgraph DAG algorithm with 10,000+ TPS and fixed low fees governed by the Hedera Council. Stores OASIS holons, avatars, and tokens. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
